{{Term/Store|Stamina||Series, BotW, CoH}} is a recurring mechanic in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|Horses that have lots of {{Color BotW|Red|stamina}} can run at top speed for a long time. However, they can't turn well when they're running at top speed. If your horse can't turn sharply, you're more likely to hit obstacles, so think before you ask your horse to sprint.|Tasseren|BotW}}</ref>{{Name Ref|TotK}}<ref>{{Cite|If you keep your streak going, enemies will drop more {{Color CoH|Blue|diamonds}}, you'll regain {{Color CoH|Blue|stamina}} more quickly...|Trill (Cadence of Hyrule)|CoH}}</ref>

==Overview==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Stamina is a mechanic in {{BotW}}. Link can only perform certain actions when he has stamina, including [[Sprinting]], [[Spin Attack]]s, [[Climbing]], and using the [[Paraglider]].

Stamina automatically replenishes when not being used, however consuming [[Energizing Elixir|Energizing]] or [[Enduring Elixir|Enduring]] [[Food]]s or [[Elixir]] will speed this process up.

